      "updated": 1786389874183,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- What is CSS ? \n=> HTML is the structure & content of web pages , CSS is the style and\ndetails that define that web page (colors , spacing , sizes ...)\n\n- How we use CSS ?\n=> 1 - External : <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n=> 2 - Internal : <style> ... </style>\n=> 3 - Inline : <h1 style=\"...\">Title</h1>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- What is CSS ? \n=> HTML is the structure & content of web pages , CSS is the style and\ndetails that define that web page (colors , spacing , sizes ...)\n\n- How we use CSS ?\n=> 1 - External : <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n=> 2 - Internal : <style> ... </style>\n=> 3 - Inline : <h1 style=\"...\">Title</h1>",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1YjIsO5CBAf9vbr_oiOns",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 358.52981207401683,
