      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786393296870,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- CSS Selectors : \n\n- Element selectors : great for base styles , dangerous for anything specific\n (styling every <p> red because we wanted one error message)\n\n- Classes : reusable and readable (class=\"card\")\n\n- IDs : should be rare in CSS => specific element\n\n- Descendant selectors : (header nav div p) selector that is \"too deep\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- CSS Selectors : \n\n- Element selectors : great for base styles , dangerous for anything specific\n (styling every <p> red because we wanted one error message)\n\n- Classes : reusable and readable (class=\"card\")\n\n- IDs : should be rare in CSS => specific element\n\n- Descendant selectors : (header nav div p) selector that is \"too deep\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
