      "text": "- CSS Box Model : \n\n1 - Content : text / image / element\n2 - Padding : space inside the border , around the content\n3 - Border : the edge of the element\n4 - Margin : space outside the border , between elements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- CSS Box Model : \n\n1 - Content : text / image / element\n2 - Padding : space inside the border , around the content\n3 - Border : the edge of the element\n4 - Margin : space outside the border , between elements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
