      "text": "- CSS Layout (Flexbox , Grid) : \n\n- One dimension vs Two dimension : Flexbox arranges elements along a single line (row or column)\n                                            Grid arranges elements in rows and columns at once",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- CSS Layout (Flexbox , Grid) : \n\n- One dimension vs Two dimension : Flexbox arranges elements along a single line (row or column)\n                                            Grid arranges elements in rows and columns at once",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
