      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Navbar example explanation : \n\n. display : flex ; ==> Turns the container into a flex container => direct children become flex\n                         items.\n\n. justify-content ==> controls spacing along main axis (row) : accepted values : \n                                                                           - center\n                                                                           - flex-start\n                                                                           - flex-end\n                                                                           - space-between/space-around\n                                                                             space-evenly\n\n. align-items ==> controls alignment along the cross axis (column)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Navbar example explanation : \n\n. display : flex ; ==> Turns the container into a flex container => direct children become flex\n                         items.\n\n. justify-content ==> controls spacing along main axis (row) : accepted values : \n                                                                           - center\n                                                                           - flex-start\n                                                                           - flex-end\n                                                                           - space-between/space-around\n                                                                             space-evenly\n\n. align-items ==> controls alignment along the cross axis (column)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1TJwPyJ9I1uid-nOJsOwQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 393.3698425292969,
      "y": 2205.5,
      "width": 758.8795166015625,
